## ID convention

<!-- Choose one, document here, stay consistent within this methodology. -->

**This methodology uses:** `<CATEGORY>-<MODULE>-<N>` (structured)
<!-- or: `<PREFIX>-<N>` (global) -->

**Categories used:**
- `BUG` — defect
- `GAP` — missing capability
- `IDEA` — opportunity / enhancement
- `RISK` — potential future problem
- `REGRESSION` — previously closed finding reopened

IDs are namespaced by this methodology folder — `BUG-01-3` here is different from `BUG-01-3` in another methodology.

